        <UserObject label="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#B45309;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;VALUE OBJECT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;frozen dataclass&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OrderDTO&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;client_order_id, broker_order_id: str&lt;br&gt;account_id, adapter_id, symbol: str&lt;br&gt;side: BUY | SELL&lt;br&gt;status: OrderStatus&lt;br&gt;entry_price: Decimal&lt;br&gt;stop_loss, take_profit: Decimal | None&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ordered_units, remaining_units: Decimal | None&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;instrument_unknown: bool &amp;middot; raw_qty?&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;is_reduce_only: bool&lt;/b&gt; &amp;middot; linked_position_id?&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;broker_updated_at_ms, broker_seq?, source&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;seq_id: int (HLC) &amp;middot; checksum: str" tooltip="No risk field: adapters can't see equity, so risk is computed only by Oversee and stored with the verdict. The version is (broker_seq, broker_updated_at_ms, observed_seq), then seq_id: the later observation wins a tie." id="pat-odto">
