        <mxCell id="pat-n4" value="&lt;span style='background-color:#8A6D00;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;COMMENT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Observer&lt;/b&gt;: publishers never know who subscribes. Oversee is &lt;b&gt;not&lt;/b&gt; a subscriber here: it reads committed state (P9), so it can't race the consumers. &lt;b&gt;Bulkhead&lt;/b&gt;: one bounded queue per topic, so a price burst cannot starve orders, positions or account updates." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F4">
