        <mxCell id="pat-F11" value="P11 &amp;middot; Circuit Breaker (kill switch) + Gatekeeper" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;collapsible=0;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#FBE3E3;strokeColor=#0B6E99;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="pat-1">
          <mxGeometry x="800" y="2700" width="720" height="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-hs" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#2E7D32;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;CLASS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;Circuit Breaker&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HaltSwitch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;- truth: PostgreSQL halt_events&lt;br&gt;- copy: Redis halt:state&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(effective_level, halt_event_id), CAS&lt;hr size='1'&gt;+ trip(level, rule_id, reason): alerts if the level rises&lt;br&gt;+ clear(operator, why, reviewed_event_id,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;force?): releases the HARD latch&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;both under pg_advisory_xact_lock&lt;br&gt;+ apply(target): RiskSweep only, after&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;each pass (trip / system clear)&lt;br&gt;+ rehydrate(): latest halt_events &amp;rarr; CAS" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F11">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="46" width="320" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-ag" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#2E7D32;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;CLASS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;Gatekeeper&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ActionGate&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;+ allow(action): bool&lt;br&gt;SOFT: deny risk-increasing&lt;br&gt;HARD: deny everything&lt;br&gt;deny unless boot_id = run_id:epoch, halt:state&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;present, event id = MAX(halt_events.id),&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;node epoch = engine_epoch, lease valid&lt;br&gt;any Redis / PostgreSQL error &amp;rarr; deny&lt;br&gt;risk-increasing: settled, reconciled&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;after the open, no stale_mark symbol,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;no UNKNOWN; RiskSweep pass &amp;lt; 3 s old" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F11">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="46" width="300" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-hev" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#7B3F14;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;DATA STORE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;audit&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;halt_events&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;id, level, effective_level, hard_latch&lt;br&gt;rule_id, reason, by, at_ms" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#EFE3D6;strokeColor=#A0522D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F11">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="306" width="320" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-egw" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#2E7D32;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;CLASS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;Phase 2 &amp;middot; LOCKED&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ExecutionGateway&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;+ send(order) &amp;rarr; ActionGate.allow() first" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingTop=2;dashed=1;opacity=70;fillColor=#F2F2F2;strokeColor=#B71C1C;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F11">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="306" width="300" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-n11" value="&lt;span style='background-color:#8A6D00;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;COMMENT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Circuit Breaker&lt;/b&gt;: one switch, three positions; tripping it is cheap and idempotent. &lt;b&gt;Gatekeeper&lt;/b&gt;: every outbound action asks ActionGate first, so a halt can't be bypassed. In Phase 1 nothing is sent; the gate is the contract Phase 2 must keep. &lt;b&gt;Fail-closed&lt;/b&gt;: no readable halt state means no action." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F11">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="436" width="680" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-f11a" value="reads level" style="html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#333333;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="pat-1" source="pat-ag" target="pat-hs">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-f11b" value="audit" style="html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#333333;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="pat-1" source="pat-hs" target="pat-hev">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-f11c" value="allow()?" style="html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#CC0000;fontColor=#CC0000;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5000;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.5000;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;dashed=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="pat-1" source="pat-egw" target="pat-ag">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-F12" value="Pattern catalogue" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;collapsible=0;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#E6F2F8;strokeColor=#0B6E99;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="pat-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1560" y="2700" width="720" height="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-cat" value="&lt;table style='border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:10px'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;background:#E6F2F8;text-align:left'&gt;#&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;background:#E6F2F8;text-align:left'&gt;Pattern&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;background:#E6F2F8;text-align:left'&gt;Where&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;background:#E6F2F8;text-align:left'&gt;Why&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Adapter + Strategy + Factory&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;BrokerAdapter, AdapterFactory&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Swap brokers without touching bus or DB&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P1&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Retry + jitter, Heartbeat&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;ReconnectPolicy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Recover from drops, no thundering herd&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P2&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Protection Proxy&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;ReadOnlyTransport, PreToolUse hook&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Order endpoints unreachable by construction&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P3&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Canonical Data Model + Value Object&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;OrderDTO / PositionDTO / PriceDTO / AccountDTO / CashFlowDTO&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;One schema downstream; safe sharing&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P4&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Publish&amp;ndash;Subscribe + Bulkhead&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;EventBus, 4 topics&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Decoupled; bursts isolated per topic&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P5&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Dead Letter Channel + Spooler + Idempotent Retry&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;DlqSpooler, events_dlq, DlqRecoveryWorker&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Failed events parked without blocking; no duplicates&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P6&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Outbox + Unit of Work + Event Log&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;OrderStateConsumer, PositionStateConsumer&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;State and events commit atomically&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Chain of Responsibility + Memento&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Tier 1 &amp;rarr; 2 (reads); Tier 3 Memento&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Redis &amp;gt; DB; image only for an operator restore&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P7&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Cache-aside / write-through (intentional duplicate) + version CAS&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Tier1RedisCache, apply_state.lua&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Instant reads; disposable copy; heal without pausing&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P8&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;State + Supervisor&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;IntegrityWorker, AdapterConnection&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Explicit transitions; self-healing&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P9&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Observer of committed state + level-triggered sweep + Strategy rules + Registry&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Oversee, oversee:feed, RiskSweep, Rule, RuleRegistry&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Halt state recomputed every second; no timers to lose; add a rule without touching Oversee&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P10&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Strategy channels + Outbox&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;NotificationDispatcher&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Reliable, de-duplicated email / push&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P11&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Circuit Breaker + Gatekeeper (fail-closed)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;HaltSwitch (CAS on halt_event_id), ActionGate&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;One switch that stops every action; no state means no action&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P12&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Lease + fencing token (single writer)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;LeaseKeeper, engine_epoch, outbound_intent&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;One writer; a paused old leader can't corrupt state&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P13&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Health-gated election + anti-flap brake&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;HealthRecord, Campaigner, SAFE_HOLD&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;No failover to a sick node; no failover storms&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;P14&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;Market calendar&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;SessionSchedule, MarketSession, ReadinessCheck&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style='border:1px solid #BBBBBB;padding:3px;vertical-align:top'&gt;No false alarms while closed; ready at the open&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F12">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="46" width="680" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-F13" value="P12 &amp;middot; Leader lease + fencing token (single writer)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;collapsible=0;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#E6F2F8;strokeColor=#0B6E99;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="pat-1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="3330" width="720" height="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#AD1457;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;ACTIVE CLASS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;own thread / sidecar&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;LeaseKeeper&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;- lease_deadline (monotonic)&lt;br&gt;- TTL 15 s &amp;middot; fence at 12 s&lt;hr size='1'&gt;+ renew() every 1 s, next endpoint&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;on error&lt;br&gt;+ fence(): SIGKILL the engine" tooltip="Runs off the event loop, so a stalled loop can't keep a dead lease alive." id="pat-lk">
          <mxCell style="shape=process;fixedSize=1;size=7;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#C2185B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacingLeft=14;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F13">
            <mxGeometry x="20" y="46" width="320" height="140" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="pat-ep" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#7B3F14;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;DATA STORE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;fencing token = lease revision&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;engine_epoch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;epoch = (etcd cluster_id, revision)&lt;hr size='1'&gt;bump: newer revision only&lt;br&gt;every write: token in the statement" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#EFE3D6;strokeColor=#A0522D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F13">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="46" width="300" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-oi" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#7B3F14;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;DATA STORE&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;Phase 2 contract&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;outbound_intent&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;client_order_id (deterministic)&lt;br&gt;epoch &amp;middot; SENDING | SENT | UNKNOWN" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#EFE3D6;strokeColor=#A0522D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F13">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="256" width="320" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-el" value="&lt;div style='text-align:center'&gt;&lt;span style='background-color:#AD1457;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;ACTIVE CLASS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#0B6E99' style='font-size:9px'&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;laquo;SM9&amp;raquo;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;EngineLeader&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr size='1'&gt;+ init(): epoch + term row &amp;rarr; HLC &amp;rarr; FLUSHDB&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;rarr; sod catch-up &amp;rarr; SM10 init&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;rarr; SM4 &amp;#8741; SM8 (boot_id last)" style="shape=process;fixedSize=1;size=7;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#C2185B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacingLeft=14;align=left;spacingTop=2;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F13">
          <mxGeometry x="400" y="256" width="300" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-n12" value="&lt;span style='background-color:#8A6D00;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;COMMENT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fencing token&lt;/b&gt;: every write path checks the epoch, so a paused old leader can't corrupt state, and the lease keeper kills the process before its lease can expire. Brokers can't check tokens, so Phase 2 sends are excluded only within lease timing: intent first, lease check with no await, gate settle after a takeover." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="pat-F13">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="396" width="680" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pat-f13a" value="epoch on win" style="html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#333333;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;endArrow=open;endFill=0;" edge="1" parent="pat-1" source="pat-lk" target="pat-ep">
