        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sm-h_note" value="&lt;span style='background-color:#8A6D00;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:8px;font-weight:bold;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:3px;'&gt;&amp;nbsp;COMMENT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Entry into SOFT or HARD&lt;/b&gt; by trip() writes a halt_events row and alerts (SM6), only when the level rises; trip() and clear() share a PostgreSQL advisory lock. The level is set only by the &lt;b&gt;RiskSweep&lt;/b&gt; after each complete pass (every second): HARD if any rule state is HARD or the HARD latch is set; else SOFT if a SOFT state is active; else NONE after cool_down with none active. A state is active once seen for its rule's confirm_ms and released only after 5 s below a 10 % margin; a stale or estimated input caps it at SOFT, and HARD needs uncapped inputs. A SOFT state whose accumulated uncapped time reaches T trips HARD and sets the latch; capped states only re-page. A failed pass changes nothing. Operator clear() releases the latch and is refused while the latest pass shows an active HARD state (unless forced for a capped one); acknowledge() only silences re-pages. &lt;b&gt;UNKNOWN&lt;/b&gt; is the start state, re-entered from any state when halt:state is missing or its halt_event_id differs from MAX(halt_events.id); it is left only once SM8 is READY (redis:boot_id = run_id:epoch), and leaving it only restores halt:state (written only by the CAS script). In Phase 1 nothing is sent, so the level is recorded and alerted for Phase 2 to enforce." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=3;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#D6B656;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="sm-S5">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="360" width="1060" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sm-S6" value="SM6 &amp;middot; Alert delivery (email / mobile push)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;collapsible=0;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#FCE4EC;strokeColor=#0B6E99;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="sm-1">
          <mxGeometry x="1180" y="1620" width="1080" height="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sm-n_init" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#1A1A1A;strokeColor=#1A1A1A;" vertex="1" parent="sm-S6">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="148" width="24" height="24" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
